    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105457" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐχ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like hair, like a hair,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				620b17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				691a7
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.9.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.2.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωνία τ.</span> notes <i>fine as
				hairs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Aud.</u>
				803b24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>mixed with hair,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηλός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					3.17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριχώδη: ὄργανα πολιορκητικά, πρὸς
				χώρησιν</span> (fort. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχύρωσιν</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἐπιτήδεια,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
